e__0_la8\",\"children\":\"2026-09-09 台股震盪收紅，塑膠、橡膠族群表現亮眼\"}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\",\"children\":\"本文目錄\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-1\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現總覽\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、族群漲跌與焦點\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、個股表現觀察\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與市場籌碼\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤勢與重要消息\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"2026年9月9日台股加權指數今日小幅上漲 0.16%，收在 47183.36 點，櫃買指數也同步收紅 0.22%。整體盤面氣氛偏向溫和，上市上漲家數明顯多於下跌家數。\"}],[[\"$\",\"figure\",\"figure-0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"越後面越熱鬧，通常也越貴、越好離開佈局沒新聞命名故事出現擁擠人人都知退燒利多變鈍新聞出現時，常常已經不是第一段\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"示意圖｜題材四階段：佈局 → 命名 → 擁擠 → 退燒（教學結構，不是某檔實盤）\"}]]}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"台股加權指數與櫃買指數雙雙收紅。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"塑膠、橡膠、油電燃氣族群表現強勢。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"外資與自營商現貨市場同步賣超。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"國際盤美股費半指數上漲，韓股走強。\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現總覽\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日台股加權指數與櫃買指數皆以小幅上漲作收。上市股票上漲家數多於下跌家數，顯示盤面氣氛相對溫和。期貨市場方面，台指期也呈現上漲。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"指數名稱\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"收盤價\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"當日漲跌幅\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"成交金額/未平倉\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"加權指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"47183.36\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+0.16%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"7386.0 億\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"櫃買指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"408.09\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+0.22%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"N/A\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"台指期\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"47187.0\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+0.44%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"98469 口\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、族群漲跌與焦點\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"觀察今日各產業族群表現，塑膠工業、橡膠工業、油電燃氣業和光電業呈現相對強勢。另一方面，創新版股票、金融保險、農業科技業則表現較為疲弱。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"塑膠工業上漲 1.28%，領漲個股為 1312 國喬。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"橡膠工業上漲 1.16%，領漲個股為 2104 國際中橡。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"油電燃氣業上漲 1.14%，領漲個股為 6505 台塑化。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"光電業上漲 0.84%，領漲個股為 3406 玉晶光。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"創新版股票下跌 1.01%，為今日表現最弱勢族群。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":\"金融保險與金融業分別下跌 0.85% 和 0.51%。\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、個股表現觀察\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日上市漲幅榜上，建通、晟鈦、光罩等個股漲幅接近一成。跌幅榜則由神達領跌，沛爾生醫-創和金橋等個股跌幅較大。在當沖熱門股方面，耀穎、仲恩生醫、沛爾生醫-創等個股成交量比相對較高。\"}],\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"],null]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"上市漲幅榜前三名為 2460 建通 (+9.96%)、3229 晟鈦 (+9.96%)、2338 光罩 (+9.93%)。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"上市跌幅榜前三名為 3706 神達 (-10.41%)、6949 沛爾生醫-創 (-9.11%)、6133 金橋 (-7.55%)。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"當沖熱門股中，耀穎量比達 23.0x，仲恩生醫量比達 18.9x，沛爾生醫-創量比達 14.2x。\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!外資賣超!自營商賣超!國際盤震盪!融資維持率\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"需留意現象\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與市場籌碼\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日外資與自營商在現貨市場皆呈現賣超。外資在台指期貨市場的淨空單部位仍維持在較高水位。整體市場的融資維持率顯示目前市場的信用交易狀況。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"法人\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"現貨買賣超 (張)\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"台指期淨部位 (口)\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-103,283\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"81,066 (淨空單)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"自營商\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-212,345\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"N/A\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤勢與重要消息\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"觀察國際股市，美國主要指數呈現漲跌互見，其中費城半導體指數上漲。亞洲股市方面，韓國綜合指數表現強勁，而日經 225 指數則小幅下跌。今日台股相關新聞主要聚焦於個別公司的營收表現，而國際上則有關於美國政策與貿易的討論。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"國際盤表現：S&P 500 -0.58%、那斯達克 -0.32%、費城半導體 +1.30%、韓國綜合（KOSPI） +1.40%、日經 225 -0.19%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"今日台股新聞標題提及智邦 8 月營收再寫新高，聯強 8 月業績創次高。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"近三日川普／美國政策相關標題包括「川普以進口禁令與加徵關稅反擊加拿大」、「供應問題與美國關稅憂慮推升倫敦金屬交易所銅價創歷史新高」。\"}]]}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天大盤表現如何？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"加權指數上漲 0.16%，櫃買指數上漲 0.22%，兩者皆以小幅上漲作收。上市上漲家數多於下跌家數，顯示盤面氣氛相對溫和。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"哪些產業族群今天表現比較好？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"塑膠工業、橡膠工業、油電燃氣業和光電業是今天表現較強勢的族群。其中塑膠工業上漲 1.28%，油電燃氣業上漲 1.14%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"法人今天在現貨市場的動向是什麼？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"外資今日在現貨市場賣超約 103,283 張，自營商也賣超約 212,345 張。兩大法人在現貨市場呈現同步賣超。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"國際股市今天表現如何？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"美國 S&P 500 指數下跌 0.58%，那斯達克指數下跌 0.32%，但費城半導體指數上漲 1.30%。亞洲股市中，韓國綜合指數上漲 1.40%，日經 225 指數則下跌 0.19%。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"總結今日台股，加權指數與櫃買指數皆小幅收紅，盤面氣氛相對平穩。塑膠、橡膠等傳產族群表現亮眼，而法人在現貨市場則同步呈現賣超。\"}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-新手導覽\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"新手導覽\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-台股學堂\",{\"href\":\"/school\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"台股學堂\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-大盤總覽\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"大盤總覽\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-今日戰情\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"今日戰情\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n13:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nf:null\n1f:I[80622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n11:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2026-09-09 台股震盪收紅，塑膠、橡膠族群表現亮眼｜股市大佬 TradeBoss\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"2026年9月9日台股加權指數今日小幅上漲 0.16%，收在 47183.36 點，櫃買指數也同步收紅 0.22%。整體盤面氣氛偏向溫和，上市上漲家數明顯多於下跌家數。\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"$L1f\",\"3\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n16:\"$11:metadata\"\n"}